WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.338
-[shouts]
-[patrons gasp]

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:06.506
Yassan!

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.092
-[grunts]
-[patrons gasp]

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.391
I almost landed my attack this time.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:17.559
[Yasuke groans]

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.436
Stop bothering me.

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.562
I don't care.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.940
Ichiro, I told you, no training in my bar.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.900
You're scaring away the customers.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.402
-[groaning]
-[glass shatters]

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:33.700
-[people gasp]
-[Yasuke] Leave the boy alone.

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:35.452
[merchant mutters nervously]

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:36.953
[chuckles]

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.957
Guess I'll have
to shut your mouth for you.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.460
-[bystander] Get back, get back!
-[crowd murmurs]

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:46.129
[mellow electronic music playing]

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:53.720
[swordsman grunting]

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:55.221
[both grunting]

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.224
[gasps, groans]

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:03.146
-[both grunting]
-[onlookers clamor]

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:06.483
[gasps]

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.194
[grunts]

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.365
-[music resumes]
-[groaning]

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:16.284
[men gasp]

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:17.869
[grunting]

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.873
[grunting]

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.471
[gurgling, groaning]

00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:38.932
History will forget you!

00:01:39.557 --> 00:01:40.934
[general shouts]

00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:45.480
[thud]

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:52.737
[thud]

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:57.242
Saki!

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:05.875
Accept the light of the Lord inside you!

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.502
[straining]

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:09.045
[growling]

00:02:09.087 --> 00:02:10.505
[screaming]

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:12.715
[straining]

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.259
-[screaming]
-[grunts]

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:19.097
[straining]

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:22.058
[loud crack]

00:02:24.602 --> 00:02:26.354
[growling]

00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:28.773
-[roars]
-[gasps]

00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:33.945
Where's the girl?

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.572
[Yasuke] Far from here.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:39.075
I hope for your sake
you fight better than you lie.

00:02:39.576 --> 00:02:42.328
[overlapping grunts]

00:02:48.626 --> 00:02:49.502
[choked grunt]

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:51.588
[gasps softly]

00:02:54.257 --> 00:02:55.133
[yells]

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:00.263
[armored man] Giant!

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:05.101
Drop your weapon and turn slowly.

00:03:14.611 --> 00:03:15.486
[woman gasps]

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.698
[panting]

